+- Write complete, working TypeScript code
+- NEVER delete test files or modify package.json/tsconfig.json
+
+## Step 3: Verify (MANDATORY -- do this EVERY time after writing code)
+```bash
+npm install 2>/dev/null
+npm run build
+npm test
+npm run lint
